Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:43.01,Hdr,,0,0,0,,May 29, 2022 - Japanese Derby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Round the final turn into Fuchu's long, long straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,They've fanned out right across the track
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,From the outside, Ask Victor More takes the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:11.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,And Satsuki Sho winner Geoglyph is chasing hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:14.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Out wide - here he comes, Do Deuce! Do Deuce is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:17.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,And right behind him, Equinox
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Past the 200 mark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:22.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do Deuce takes over - Equinox chasing him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Ask Victor More - and Dannebrog is closing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:28.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do Deuce or Equinox - side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do Deuce just in front at the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:37.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do Deuce wins a fierce race - revenge for the Satsuki Sho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:41.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Truly a champion's finish - Do Deuce is top of his generation!